00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:31.190
I need every state to stay home, shut down
all nonessential businesses, take out and

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:36.840
delivery only at restaurants, cancel unnecessary
medical appointments, no schooling, etc, etc.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.870
Trump should say I need that for the next
17 days.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:44.140
If you want me to be able to reopen partially,
you know, maybe young people in some states.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.630
I don't know if he's determined to do it.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:50.400
Say you need all 50 states to do the damn
thing because otherwise it's not going to

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.400
